    "warnings": [
      "This is a substantive combinatorial incidence problem concerning extremal counts on finite point sets.",
      "The result directly concerns configurations defined by a metric constraint, making metric geometry a plausible classification.",
      "This code precisely describes the named discrete-geometric problem and the theorem's contribution to it.",
      "Although number fields do not appear in the exported theorem statement, they are central mathematical ingredients of the recorded result rather than formalization tools, so the code has a reasonable substantive connection.",
